{"id":"wb-5-462","name":"桂林石刻","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"桂林石刻","text":"桂林石刻是中华人民共和国广西壮族自治区桂林市境内，二十多座名山胜处的石刻遗迹。2001年，列入第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n桂林石刻的历史从东晋延续到民国。这些年间古人留下了两千多件石刻，使桂林成为全国摩崖石刻最多的地方，尤其宋代有近五百件石刻作品，居全国宋代题刻之最。石刻中留下的山水诗词、游记散文有近二百万字，成为桂林石刻的主流内容。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%A1%82%E6%9E%97%E7%9F%B3%E5%88%BB","revisionId":95287266,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95287266","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/a549f61dcd88c52f128822b6.jpg","title":"Guihaibeilin.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Guihaibeilin.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9d/Guihaibeilin.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"原上传者为中文維基百科的Flsxx","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","caption":"​桂林石刻","width":320,"height":240}}